{"id":"914b63100f991c01","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-sequent.md","title":"双边相继式与单边相继式","display":"df-sequent — 双边相继式与单边相继式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-sequent","aliases":["18-df-sequent","18-df-028"],"display":"df-sequent — 双边相继式与单边相继式","depends_on":["[[18-df-formula]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"§4.3, before Definition 4.3.2","source_pages":"54","source_pdf_pages":"64","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-sequent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-sequent</span><span>18-df-028</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequent — 双边相继式与单边相继式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.3, before Definition 4.3.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"54"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"64"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a> 的签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 和构造树公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[E]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([E]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 表示集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的有穷子集族；双边写法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\)</span> 是有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[E]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathcal P(E)\\mid |a|&lt;\\omega\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\coloneqq[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{&lt;\\omega}\\times[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[E]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathcal P(E)\\mid |a|&lt;\\omega\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\coloneqq[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{&lt;\\omega}\\times[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OneSeq}_S\\coloneqq[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OneSeq}_S\\coloneqq[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §4.3 使用单边有穷公式集，并作析取解释。本节点保留既有双边支撑接口，另明确单边接口；两个载体不能混用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[18-df-formula]] 的签名 $S$ 和构造树公式集 $\\mathrm{Fml}_S$。$[E]^{<\\omega}$ 表示集合 $E$ 的有穷子集族；双边写法 $\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta$ 是有序对 $\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"[E]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"[E]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathcal P(E)\\mid |a|<\\omega\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\coloneqq[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{<\\omega}\\times[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{<\\omega}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OneSeq}_S\\coloneqq[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{<\\omega}.","display":true}],"bytes":1156,"backlinks":[{"id":"5d15fa98a4af2340","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p,q,s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S$，$\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{<\\omega}$，$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，均按 [[18-df-sequent]]。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-sequent]]"},{"id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[18-df-sequent]] 的相继式集合 $\\mathrm{Seq}_S$。$\\ast$ 为不属于 $\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 的标签，$\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Seq}_S)\\times\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\times(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\cup\\{\\ast\\})$ 是给定的规则实例集，三个分量依次为前提标签集、结论和切公式标签。$\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)$ 是候选五元组；$m\\prec n$ 表示 $m$ 是 $n$ 的直接前提节点。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-sequent]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-sequent]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-sequent|18-df-sequent]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-sequent|18-df-sequent]]"}],"outgoing":["2718a8a11c383b33"]}